# Quarto render artifacts (source .qmd is tracked, html/cache are regenerated)
*_files/
*_cache/
**/*.html

# Figure and QC renders are regenerated from the scripts; the data intermediates
# in c_data/ stay tracked so a clone builds figures without re-running upstream.
**/b_reports/**/*.png
**/b_reports/**/*.pdf

# The per-arm imputed DEP tables are terminal: 01_run_dep_imputed.R writes them and
# nothing reads them back. The QC figure reads the sensitivity and concordance
# summaries beside them, and the figures read DAList_imputed_missforest.rds, so both
# of those stay tracked. 17 MB of results that no clone needs.
03_DEP/b_imputed/c_data/*/combined_results_pi.csv
